Z||000000||TheFiero64||05-01-2001||06:47 PM|||| I just got my baby out of the paint shop and I can't believe the shine. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I will definitely be ready for Carlisle. (See pics below)<P>  Today I went to Wal-Mart to pick up a few things. I parked my baby so it was away from the other cars so it wouldn't get scratched. When Jaygee & I got back to the car and were getting in, I heard a lady saying excuse me. I said, yes? She asked if it was just us two. I said yes I only have 2 seats. She said someone was trying to get into my car. I WAS SO PISSED. She said he took off into the bushes when they saw her sitting in her car. I went looking, GOOD thing I didn't find them. I think I would have hurt them badly! I guess my Fiero is not safe anywhere. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> There was no marks on my car thank god.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=12780538&p=47700492&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=12780538&p=47700494&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=12780538&p=47700498&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=12780538&p=47700501&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>Rest of the pics are <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1249362&a=12780538&f=0" TARGET=_blank>here</A> <P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||05-01-2001||06:57 PM||||Man that things glowing. What did you do to the suspension? I looks like you lowered it. <P>Its a good thing that lady was there. I know that its not 100% but I still use The Club on my fiero because it will take longer for the thief to brake in and might deter them from doing so. Car alarms are a joke. No one around here cares if an alarm is sounding because it happens all the time.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||rogergarrison||05-01-2001||07:53 PM||||LOOKIN GOOD !!!!!! Id shoot anyone I caught trying to get in mine. The police are only there to fine you, not protect and serve, believe me. I call police all the time around here, sometimes takes them 2 hours if at all, im only a mile from station.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Mach10||05-01-2001||07:55 PM||||Alarms are great... Get out of the car, take a few steps, hit the arm, and "Boop-Boop"<BR>I loves it!<BR>Then you get a bumpersticker with the following:<P>"If you think my Alarm is Cool, wait 'till you find the shock-tasers in the seats"<P>Works for me!<P>Honestly, the best anti-theft device around is a 500gm bag of 24Ga BARBED fishhooks, and a couple of tubes of 5-min epoxy. Line the underside and inside of the dash and steering column with 'em. Almost no injury to the poor bastard when he/she gets stuck, but I guarantee that they're gonna have a tough time getting themselves free. Imagine trying to get yourself off of 15 barbed hooks stuck in your hand at once? Works SOOOoooo much better than razor blades &gt;:}<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000004||Taijiguy||05-01-2001||08:45 PM||||I wired the leg of my alarm that supposedly disables the starter, to the fuel pump. I also hid a switch in an inconspicuous place, so if someone were to try and carjack me, I can jab the button as I get out of the car and it will shut down the fuel pump. They'll get only as far as the fuel in the carb bowls will take them. Then of course it dies. They aren't going to stick around, and I'm too far away for them to try and do anything to me. Hopefully though I'll never have to find out how effective it is.||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroLisa||05-01-2001||08:58 PM||||If anyone ever so much as touches my car, I swear to god.......||||reg||1
Z||000006||JSocha||05-01-2001||09:24 PM||||Check the sail panels!  Might be the same clowns from an earlier thread  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Your car is Aaaaahhhwwwwwsome!  Good job!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jnjsochasig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||fiero56||05-01-2001||09:40 PM||||Few years back during spring break in high-school, I woke up from a nap(nascar was on tv, that's how boring that afternoon was <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">), and went out to grab a CD from my car(pre Fiero days). I pushed the garage door button, and by the time it lifted, there were two guys just beginning to walk away from my car with "jimmy sticks" in hand back to their Aerostar. I didn't even realize what was going on until they were out of sight. But, if I had been awake and competent at that time, I am fairly certain I would have been charged with whatever you get charged with for beating someone repeatedly until they are either unconscious or dead. Luckily, I interupted them before they got in my car. And, lucky for them(maybe myself, you never know who's armed), I didn't realize what was going on until they were gone.||||reg||1
Z||000008||rogergarrison||05-01-2001||09:45 PM||||we just had a guy here murdered on a store parking lot in one of the busiest parts of town. two guys walked up and ordered him to give up his car (a Ricer with like 18'' chrome wheels) instead he took off, they shot him rite there and left. <P>I know what you mean fiero. I was asleep once and the alarm went off in my hemi-cuda about 2 am. I just went out and turned it off, and noticed the vent wing open. Then I saw a car leaving the driveway. I shot at them 3 or 4 times, but they kept going.  I guess my aims not too good after waking up quick.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 05-01-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000009||fiero56||05-01-2001||10:45 PM||||I lived in Columbus while going to school there. Worst damn downtown city I've ever been to(and downtown Dayton is terrible to say the least). Unfortunately, student housing I got was south of Obetz, near an airport. My car alarm(Fiero) went off at 3am one night, so I grabbed my pipe-wrench from the kitchen(near the back door), and walked through the dark to the parking lot. Turned out it was my roomates playing a joke since they didn't have exams the next morning. I was all set for some a$$ whooping. I never had any problems while living there, most all of my friends had at least one "incident"(one involved the FBI breaking down a front door looking for a guy named "Larry", we never did figure that one out). I did have a gun pulled on me once. Mid-morning, on my way to school, lots of traffic, middle of the street, there was a reason I had a pipe-wrench in my car too, and I was reaching for it.||||reg||1
Z||000010||TheFiero64||05-02-2001||12:34 PM||||Thanks for all the good comments. <B>88formula</B> It is the stock suspension as far as I know. <P><BR>I am definitely going to look into some kind of security. I just couldn't believe it.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
